lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">bl</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN32/Nat.html#MPN.W32.Nat.rem2\">rem2</a> <span class=\"fn\">ah</span> <span class=\"fn\">al</span> <span class=\"fn\">bl</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">ah</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">64</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">al</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">bl</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN32/Nat.html#MPN.W32.Nat.toNat_rem2","kind":"theorem","line":864,"name":"MPN.W32.Nat.toNat_rem2","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN32/Nat.lean#L864-L903"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Nat.html#MPN.W32.Nat.rem2\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Nat</span>.<span class=\"name\">rem2</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ah </span><span class=\"fn\">al </span><span class=\"fn\">bl</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`(ah β + al) % bl` in words: by `divRem128L` for `bl ≥ 2³²`, and below by three remainders of words,\neach of a remainder followed by 32 more bits, which fits in a word.","docLink":"./MPN32/Nat.html#MPN.W32.Nat.rem2","kind":"def","line":852,"name":"MPN.W32.Nat.rem2","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN32/Nat.lean#L852-L862"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Nat.html#MPN.W32.Nat.toNat_mulWide_snd\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Nat</span>.<span class=\"name\">toNat_mulWide_snd</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN/Natural.html#MPN.mulWide\">mulWide</a> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">b</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">b</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HDiv.hDiv\">/</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">64</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The high word of `a b`.","docLink":"./MPN32/Nat.html#MPN.W32.Nat.toNat_mulWide_snd","kind":"theorem","line":827,"name":"MPN.W32.Nat.toNat_mulWide_snd","sourceLink":"https://github